{
  "esm": "0.8.0",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "ppm_lev_edge",
    "description": "Colella-Woodward (1984) eq. (1.6) non-uniform 4th-order interpolation of a cell-averaged field to the interface a_{j+1/2} between cells j and j+1, on an arbitrarily-spaced 1-D mesh. Given four consecutive cell averages (am,a0,ap,app) = (a_{j-1},a_j,a_{j+1},a_{j+2}) and their widths (dm,d0,dp,dpp), it returns a_{j+1/2} = a0 + d0/(d0+dp)(ap-a0) + (1/(dm+d0+dp+dpp))[ (2 dp d0/(d0+dp))((dm+d0)/(2d0+dp) - (dpp+dp)/(2dp+d0))(ap-a0) - d0(dm+d0)/(2d0+dp) da_{j+1} + dp(dp+dpp)/(2dp+d0) da_j ], where da_j, da_{j+1} are the CW84 eq.(1.7) non-uniform average slopes (../stencils/ppm_lev_slope) at cells j and j+1. On a uniform mesh this collapses exactly to the (7/12)(a0+ap) - (1/12)(am+app) edge of ppm_face_value, and on the quadratic-stretch vertical it is verified 4th-order accurate (interior). This is the UNLIMITED reconstruction (no monotonicity clip), so it keeps the full 4th-order convergence; the CW84 monotonicity limiter is a documented follow-on. Compositional middle piece: it composes two ppm_lev_slope calls and is itself composed by ppm_lev_flux (which scales the edge by the interface velocity). Grid-agnostic scalar algebra; match-less named template.",
    "license": "MIT",
    "tags": [
      "esd:stencil",
      "family:finite_volume",
      "grid:latlon3d",
      "op:reconstruct",
      "order:4",
      "stencil_width:4"
    ],
    "references": [
      {
        "citation": "Colella, P., & Woodward, P. R. (1984). The Piecewise Parabolic Method (PPM) for gas-dynamical simulations. Journal of Computational Physics, 54(1), 174-201. Equations (1.6)-(1.7), non-uniform mesh.",
        "doi": "10.1016/0021-9991(84)90143-8"
      }
    ]
  },
  "expression_template_imports": [
    { "ref": "./ppm_lev_slope.esm" }
  ],
  "expression_templates": {
    "ppm_lev_edge": {
      "params": ["am", "a0", "ap", "app", "dm", "d0", "dp", "dpp"],
      "description": "CW84 eq.(1.6) non-uniform edge value a_{j+1/2}",
      "body": {
        "op": "+",
        "args": [
          {
            "op": "+",
            "args": [
              "a0",
              {
                "op": "*",
                "args": [
                  { "op": "/", "args": ["d0", { "op": "+", "args": ["d0", "dp"] }] },
                  { "op": "-", "args": ["ap", "a0"] }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "op": "*",
            "args": [
              { "op": "/", "args": [1, { "op": "+", "args": ["dm", "d0", "dp", "dpp"] }] },
              {
                "op": "+",
                "args": [
                  {
                    "op": "*",
                    "args": [
                      { "op": "/", "args": [{ "op": "*", "args": [2, "dp", "d0"] }, { "op": "+", "args": ["d0", "dp"] }] },
                      {
                        "op": "-",
                        "args": [
                          { "op": "/", "args": [{ "op": "+", "args": ["dm", "d0"] }, { "op": "+", "args": [{ "op": "*", "args": [2, "d0"] }, "dp"] }] },
                          { "op": "/", "args": [{ "op": "+", "args": ["dpp", "dp"] }, { "op": "+", "args": [{ "op": "*", "args": [2, "dp"] }, "d0"] }] }
                        ]
                      },
                      { "op": "-", "args": ["ap", "a0"] }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "op": "*",
                    "args": [
                      {
                        "op": "-",
                        "args": [
                          { "op": "/", "args": [{ "op": "*", "args": ["d0", { "op": "+", "args": ["dm", "d0"] }] }, { "op": "+", "args": [{ "op": "*", "args": [2, "d0"] }, "dp"] }] }
                        ]
                      },
                      {
                        "op": "apply_expression_template",
                        "args": [],
                        "name": "ppm_lev_slope",
                        "bindings": { "am": "a0", "a0": "ap", "ap": "app", "dm": "d0", "d0": "dp", "dp": "dpp" }
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "op": "*",
                    "args": [
                      { "op": "/", "args": [{ "op": "*", "args": ["dp", { "op": "+", "args": ["dp", "dpp"] }] }, { "op": "+", "args": [{ "op": "*", "args": [2, "dp"] }, "d0"] }] },
                      {
                        "op": "apply_expression_template",
                        "args": [],
                        "name": "ppm_lev_slope",
                        "bindings": { "am": "am", "a0": "a0", "ap": "ap", "dm": "dm", "d0": "d0", "dp": "dp" }
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  }
}
